B.ckv={"Steady! Guard the general!":0,"A check. I have seen worse.":1,"Hold the palace!":2,"A costly loss. It will not happen twice.":3,"Fall back and regroup!":4,"You will pay for that piece.":5,"Left unguarded? Then it is mine.":6,"Every gap in your line, I will find.":7,"One fewer to stand against me.":8,"That was not the way.":9,"You lost the thread. Find it again.":10,"Well fought. I yield the field.":11,"Retreat! Sound the retreat!":12,"Train harder, and come again.":13,"The field is mine today.":14,[u.BR]:15,"Man the ramparts!":16,"One watchtower falls. The wall is long.":17,"Bricks can be laid again.":18,"Nothing crosses my frontier unpunished.":19,"The north wind takes another.":20,"So the wall has a gate after all.":21,"As I said. The wall still stands.":22,[u.oX]:23,[u.cB]:24,"One general lost. I have a hundred more.":25,[u.pI]:26,[u.u_]:27,"The weak exist to be swallowed.":28,[u.fr]:29,[u.sN]:30,[u.yB]:31,[u.Bb]:32,"Heaven takes this from me, not you.":33,"A petal falls. The tree still stands.":34,[u.rI]:35,[u.ot]:36,"Go, my king. Do not look back.":37,"No farewell tonight.":38,"Bah. My generals will see to it.":39,"Advisers! Why did no one warn me?":40,[u.fs]:41,"Guard the granaries! Guard Wuchao!":42,"Numbers always win in the end.":43,"Four provinces stand behind that move.":44,[u.rb]:45,"Full granaries, a vast army. I told you.":46,"I told him this would happen.":47,[u.rF]:48,"Was that the wind\u2026 or their army?":49,[u.dq]:50,[u.w7]:51,"Swept away like straw on the river.":52,[u.yo]:53,[u.qf]:54,[u.jr]:55,"Close ranks! Bring the ships about!":56,[u.pW]:57,"What lies beneath this water?":58,"Sunk. The river belongs to the Yuan.":59,[u.Dq]:60,[u.gu]:61,"The river could not stop me after all.":62,"A skirmish in the passes. Nothing more.":63,"Keep the column moving!":64,[u.d]:65,"A scout lost. The army marches on.":66,[u.f1]:67,"Easier than I expected.":68,"The pass\u2026 it closed behind us.":69,"A Ming army goes where it pleases.":70,"Patience. A river cannot hold forever.":71,"Who is chanting on the far bank?":72,"The current takes one. I can wait.":73,"Fever and the river. Both against me.":74,"A crossing, at last.":75,"Every river can be crossed. I told you.":76,[u.yN]:77,"Patience crosses every river.":78,[u.gw]:79,"Keep sailing. Stay in the channel.":80,"Fire from the riverbanks?":81,"One boat lost in the reeds.":82,[u.v7]:83,"The river carries me forward.":84,"Between R\u1ea1ch G\u1ea7m and Xo\xe0i M\xfat\u2026 a trap.":85,"I told you to step aside.":86,"At New Year? Who attacks at New Year?":87,"Pour the wine. This is nothing.":88,"A small loss. The festival goes on.":89,[u.BK]:90,"Thang Long welcomes its new masters.":91,[u.BY]:92,[u.rH]:93,"We feast in Thang Long after all.":94,[u.dM]:95,"A queen of the Xiongnu does not panic.":96,"One horseman falls. The herd runs on.":97,"Like a goose fallen from the sky.":98,[u.cA]:99,"Peace has a price. You just paid it.":100,[u.sz]:101,[u.nM]:102,"This oasis has seen sieges before.":103,"To the walls, Returning Righteous Army!":104,[u.k1]:105,"In time, sand covers every loss.":106,[u.nQ]:107,[u.hb]:108,"Then the oasis changes hands again.":109,"This oasis stays with the Righteous.":110,[u.xa]:111,"Send gifts to both sides!":112,"The salt lake swallows another.":113,"A small price for a long road.":114,[u.c9]:115,"Caravans pay. So do you.":116,[u.vA]:117,"Loulan remains.":118,"I have faced worse at Hanjiang Pass.":119,"The Woman General does not flinch.":120,"A fair strike. I will answer it.":121,[u.te]:122,"Captured, like a certain young general.":123,"The Tian Shan is quiet again.":124,"Spurned again. I will be back.":125,[u.rL]:126,"The road is long. I am patient.":127,"Hold the line by the river!":128,"A loss. Fate has not spoken yet.":129,"My allies are watching. So am I.":130,"Your allies have left you, traveler.":131,"At the end of every road, a toll.":132,"Then the road goes on, beyond me.":133,"The road ends here, as I said.":134,"Ha! You dare poke the tiger?":135,[u.jA]:136,"Argh! Bring me wine, I will win it back!":137,"A lucky blow!":138,"HA! Onto my serpent spear!":139,"Who is next?!":140,"Bah! Again tomorrow. I demand it!":141,[u.aI]:142,"Get behind me, my lord!":143,"Nothing passes this gate.":144,[u.eH]:145,[u.Dh]:146,"Crushed.":147,"Come closer. I prefer it.":148,"The gate\u2026 held long enough.":149,"My lord is safe.":150,"You have learned some tricks. So have I.":151,[u.A4]:152,"Noted. I will study that.":153,"A fair trade, perhaps. We shall see.":154,"I am no longer the Ah Meng of Wu.":155,"Merchants in white, soldiers underneath.":156,[u.gE]:157,"Jing Province fell the same way.":158,"How forward of you.":159,[u.qs]:160,"You took the bait. Or did I?":161,"A small sacrifice, gracefully made.":162,"You were looking elsewhere.":163,[u.sG]:164,[u.m]:165,"Never underestimate a dancer.":166,[u.CB]:167,"Calm. Hold the line.":168,"A worthy strike.":169,"I will ride back for it.":170,"Zhao Zilong of Changshan takes it.":171,"Through the gap, as at Changban.":172,"An honorable game. I salute you.":173,"Courage in every vein. You fought well.":174,"You threaten Guan Yunchang?":175,"My beard is not even ruffled.":176,"Hm. You have some skill.":177,[u.qx]:178,"The Green Dragon blade does not miss.":179,"Done before the wine grows cold.":180,[u.Cl]:181,"Five passes, six generals. Add one more.":182,[u.R]:183,"Fire needs only one spark. Mind yours.":184,"Hm. A wrong note.":185,"Heaven gave you that one.":186,"Ashes on the river.":187,"Chained ships burn together.":188,[u.lw]:189,"The east wind blows my way.":190,[u.BT]:191,"Too obvious. There must be a trap.":192,"Let it go. Time is on my side.":193,"I have lost battles and won wars.":194,"I only had to wait.":195,"Old men outlive clever ones.":196,"Withdraw. I will outlast you yet.":197,"Patience wins dynasties.":198,"As expected.":199,"The fan does not stop for a check.":200,"A piece given is a piece placed.":201,"Interesting. I did not foresee that.":202,"It was written in the stars.":203,"Borrowed, like arrows from straw boats.":204,"Man plans; Heaven decides. Well played.":205,"Everything went according to plan.":206,[u.hZ]:207,[u.Da]:208,[u.fb]:209,[u.la]:210,[u.oI]:211,[u.vr]:212,[u.qT]:213,[u.ui]:214,[u.de]:215,[u.nj]:216,[u.k_]:217,"The pass is narrow. So is your chance.":218,[u.sV]:219,"The Song have time. Do you?":220,[u.fO]:221,[u.lE]:222,"The current carries me straight to you.":223,[u.By]:224,[u.tQ]:225,[u.fe]:226,[u.CJ]:227,[u.uB]:228,[u.mm]:229,[u.p8]:230,[u.Cx]:231,[u.qH]:232,"Draw up your lines. My spear is waiting.":233,[u.lN]:234,[u.mO]:235,[u.Fu]:236,[u.ft]:237,[u.d_]:238,[u.nv]:239,[u.pi]:240,[u.Fz]:241,[u.xT]:242,[u.sQ]:243,"Surrounded, yes. Beaten, never.":244,[u.tR]:245,[u.rw]:246,[u.oZ]:247,"We outnumber them ten to one. Advance!":248,[u.CD]:249,[u.t4]:250,[u.l0]:251,"Was that a crane, or their war cry?":252,[u.zf]:253,[u.oe]:254,"Did something just scrape the hull?":255,"The tide is going out fast. Too fast.":256,[u.sW]:257,[u.g8]:258,[u.u8]:259,[u.Cv]:260,[u.Fs]:261,[u.m6]:262,"Build rafts. We cross at first light.":263,[u.iI]:264,[u.lF]:265,"The river is calm. Too calm.":266,[u.nT]:267,"What is moving in the reeds by the bank?":268,[u.Fi]:269,"Fireworks? No... those are cannons.":270,[u.pn]:271,"The fort at Ngoc Hoi will hold.":272,[u.oj]:273,[u.fQ]:274,[u.p6]:275,[u.l5]:276,[u.hE]:277,[u.gL]:278,"Sand on the wind. Keep your eyes open.":279,[u.xR]:280,[u.EO]:281,[u.b9]:282,[u.CC]:283,"Snow to the waist, and still we climb.":284,[u.Dt]:285,[u.rx]:286,[u.kf]:287,[u.in]:288,[u.lD]:289,[u.fN]:290,[u.e2]:291,[u.fa]:292,[u.sw]:293,[u.xX]:294,"A deserter, nothing more.":295,[u.Dy]:296,"Another fire goes out in your camp.":297,[u.Di]:298,"So it was carved for me after all.":299,"No tree bears my name tonight.":300,[u.ag]:301,[u.aZ]:302,[u.e5]:303,[u.x6]:304,[u.Am]:305,"One city cannot hold forever.":306,"What is that noise in the dark?":307,[u.vB]:308,"Cattle? You fight with cattle?":309,"Your granaries grow thinner by the day.":310,"Starve or surrender. Either suits me.":311,[u.Dd]:312,"Jimo falls, and Qi with it.":313,[u.wb]:314,"Yue Yi was too patient. I am not Yue Yi.":315,[u.xh]:316,[u.jS]:317,[u.cN]:318,[u.ws]:319,"A bold move. I have read about bolder.":320,"That was not in any of my books.":321,[u.CY]:322,"Exactly as the classics describe.":323,"Theory wins again.":324,[u.l1]:325,[u.yX]:326,"I have read every book of war. Have you?":327,[u.wt]:328,[u.mR]:329,"Our supply wagons are late again.":330,[u.k0]:331,[u.af]:332,"Hold the walls of Julu!":333,"A lucky blow from a peasant army.":334,"Who sinks his own boats? A madman.":335,"Another rebel down. I have lost count.":336,"The empire has long arms.":337,"Nine battles. Nine. I yield.":338,"Like your uncle before you.":339,[u.X]:340,[u.d3]:341,[u.fl]:342,[u.mI]:343,[u.cp]:344,"An honest blow. I respect that.":345,[u.fn]:346,[u.r]:347,"Was that a trick? How unworthy.":348,"Virtue prevails.":349,[u.oH]:350,[u.eb]:351,"No tricks needed. As I said.":352,[u.l]:353,[u.yC]:354,[u.eP]:355,[u.i3]:356,[u.mb]:357,[u.Ch]:358,"Your emperor is dead. Who sent you?":359,[u.f_]:360,"One loss. The south is wide.":361,[u.gy]:362,"Go home, northerner.":363,"Betrayed by my own allies. Of course.":364,"The emperor's word stops at this river.":365,[u.b]:366,[u.l6]:367,[u.lx]:368,[u.As]:369,[u.CQ]:370,"Ring the bell! Call the wind!":371,[u.h0]:372,"My leopards will avenge that.":373,[u.cn]:374,"Fed to the tigers.":375,"The wolves are grateful.":376,[u.kt]:377,"The jungle has fed well today.":378,"My tigers have not eaten today.":379,[u.kP]:380,[u.m_]:381,[u.DT]:382,[u.qL]:383,"Close, but my knives are closer.":384,"My husband would panic. I do not.":385,"Lucky. Do not count on it twice.":386,"That one was slow anyway.":387,"Another general for my collection.":388,"Flying daggers never miss.":389,"A feigned retreat. I should have known.":390,[u.yK]:391,"My husband talks. I throw knives.":392,[u.bJ]:393,[u.yU]:394,"Two Shu generals in our cages already.":395,[u.uX]:396,"My armour turns arrows. Try again.":397,"Is that the best the north can do?":398,"Rattan floats. So will we.":399,"Mother would laugh at me for that.":400,"My father's daughter, after all.":401,"The hills are on my side.":402,"The valley is burning. Everyone, out!":403,"The south stays free today.":404,[u.F]:405,[u.ax]:406,[u.DH]:407,[u.wk]:408,[u.rM]:409,"This time I will not be caught.":410,"Again? You cannot keep doing this!":411,"That proves nothing.":412,[u.rs]:413,"You see? I could win all along.":414,"The south fights back.":415,[u.b_]:416,"Captured me six times, but not this one.":417,[u.n]:418,[u.mo]:419,[u.fC]:420,"How many times must we fight this war?":421,[u.kp]:422,[u.yT]:423,"Mount up! Mount up!":424,"The Gobi will avenge that.":425,"How did they bring water this far?":426,"Your horses are dying of thirst.":427,"The steppe belongs to riders.":428,"A sandstorm. Ride north, now!":429,"The desert keeps its promise.":430,[u.p]:431,[u.sS]:432,[u.qI]:433,[u.E9]:434,"The wind is rising. Watch the sand.":435,[u.E7]:436,"Southern traitors ride with the Han now?":437,[u.d0]:438,"Scatter and regroup. The steppe is wide.":439,[u.qd]:440,"Your supply line is a thread. I cut it.":441,"Carve your words on the mountain, then.":442,"No inscription for you today.":443,"The steppe swallows armies whole.":444,[u.p7]:445,[u.pA]:446,[u.vO]:447,[u.pv]:448,[u.zI]:449,"Rouse the khagan! The Tang are here!":450,[u.ik]:451,"Snow and darkness. Cowards' weapons.":452,"For the house of Sui.":453,[u.AT]:454,"The Sui is gone. Now so am I.":455,[u.kh]:456,[u.W]:457,"Jieli talks of peace. I do not.":458,[u.Em]:459,[u.N]:460,[u.cH]:461,[u.gt]:462,"Interesting. Most men run by now.":463,"One arrow. I have a quiver full.":464,"Muqali, charge the slope. Now.":465,"The Jin hesitate. The Mongols do not.":466,"Your empire grows smaller. Mine grows.":467,"Even the sky has an edge, it seems.":468,[u.n6]:469,[u.i]:470,[u.B1]:471,[u.il]:472,[u.oS]:473,[u.ts]:474,"Bold. Your emperor was bold too.":475,"Guard the wells!":476,"A price worth paying for an emperor.":477,"Hold. Let them come to us.":478,"Thirsty men fight poorly.":479,"Talks are over.":480,[u.iU]:481,"Another emperor for my tent.":482,[u.L]:483,[u.l4]:484,[u.Fh]:485,[u.vK]:486,"When they move for water, we strike.":487,[u.uN]:488,[u.u9]:489,"The supplies are running low.":490,[u.BF]:491,[u.jE]:492,"Pyongyang is close now.":493,[u.lJ]:494,"No poem can save you now.":495,[u.Z]:496,[u.j5]:497,[u.oE]:498,"Rations are cut in half. Keep marching.":499,[u.oB]:500,[u.xW]:501,"Raise the ramp higher!":502,"The walls bite back. Admirable.":503,"They took my ramp? My ramp?":504,[u.uW]:505,"An emperor leads from the front.":506,[u.ee]:507,[u.co]:508,[u.P]:509,[u.i4]:510,[u.BA]:511,[u.Cy]:512,"The first frost came last night.":513,[u.kC]:514,"The old general still has teeth.":515,"That flood was cowardly.":516,"The wind is turning. Bad sign.":517,"Goryeo will kneel.":518,"Khitan riders take what they want.":519,"The wind betrayed us. Ride for home!":520,"The old man should have stayed home.":521,[u.G]:522,[u.fv]:523,[u.AW]:524,"Home is still far. Keep moving.":525,"The wind is at our backs. Good omen.":526,"Strike first, strike hard!":527,"They flee into the open sea. After them!":528,"Bait? No, just a lucky shot.":529,"Where did all those ships come from?":530,"Glory goes to the one who strikes first.":531,"The other admirals will be jealous.":532,"A crane's wing. We swam right into it.":533,"The glory is mine alone.":534,[u.ni]:535,[u.xZ]:536,[u.DJ]:537,"Why are they forming a curve out there?":538,[u.qJ]:539,"Push through! We have the numbers!":540,"The current is fighting us.":541,"Our ships keep colliding. Spread out!":542,[u.Eq]:543,"One of thirteen. Twelve to go.":544,[u.nz]:545,"Thirteen ships. I barely noticed them.":546,[u.C]:547,[u.nt]:548,[u.fG]:549,[u.xY]:550,"The water is moving the wrong way.":551,[u.gO]:552,"Strike from both flanks!":553,[u.pz]:554,[u.zc]:555,"Youzhou stays Khitan.":556,"Chase them to the river!":557,[u.sd]:558,"Fetch a donkey cart for this one too.":559,[u.M]:560,"Youzhou is ours. Come and take it.":561,[u.A7]:562,[u.EB]:563,[u.qE]:564,[u.tU]:565,"Steady. Let the Song sweat.":566,[u.qo]:567,[u.zH]:568,"Silk and silver will flow north.":569,"Your capital is very close, you know.":570,"Then let us talk terms, as equals.":571,"Peace, on my terms.":572,[u.T]:573,[u.dC]:574,[u.wO]:575,[u.CL]:576,"Watch for crossbows on the walls.":577,"The Iron Pagoda does not bend.":578,"Close ranks! Shield the horses!":579,"They aim for the horses' legs. Clever.":580,"Long axes? Against my cavalry?":581,"Iron beats flesh.":582,"Your court will recall you soon enough.":583,[u.vM]:584,"The Iron Pagoda stands.":585,"My Iron Pagoda has never been broken.":586,[u.bi]:587,[u.gW]:588,"The Song are digging in near Yancheng.":589,"Their foot soldiers carry axes. Strange.":590,[u.hp]:591,"Who leads them? Their general fled!":592,"What are those ships with wheels?":593,"A clerk is leading their army? Absurd.":594,"The Yangtze will be mine.":595,"I took a throne. I can take a river.":596,[u.am]:597,"Across the river at last.":598,[u.h]:599,[u.xN]:600,[u.iK]:601,[u.vU]:602,"Those boats move without oars. How?":603,[u.fq]:604,"Bring up the trebuchets!":605,"Your walls are stubborn. So am I.":606,[u.mq]:607,"Stone by stone, your walls come down.":608,"Fancheng first. Then you.":609,[u.it]:610,"The road to the south lies open.":611,[u.v]:612,[u.tG]:613,[u.vL]:614,[u.vk]:615,[u.iz]:616,"Cannon on the shore! Who fired that?":617,"The coast is mine. Get off it.":618,"There is always more loot.":619,"Xu Hai should have been here by now.":620,"Plunder. My favourite word.":621,[u.uV]:622,"Handed over by my own partner. Pirates.":623,"Load the ships. We sail at dawn.":624,[u.J]:625,[u.Af]:626,"The town's gates are open. Go, go, go!":627,[u.yq]:628,"Our captain trusts Xu Hai. I don't.":629,"You are cleverer than I thought.":630,[u.Cc]:631,"I gave up more than that for peace.":632,"They promised amnesty. Promises.":633,"A gentle word, then a sharp blade.":634,[u.yZ]:635,[u.x2]:636,[u.qv]:637,[u.z]:638,[u.vd]:639,[u.ya]:640,[u.fT]:641,"Keep your sword close, amnesty or not.":642,[u.xD]:643,"Hoist the red flag!":644,"Every ship lost costs you double later.":645,[u.rY]:646,"Everything you own is taxed now.":647,"The Red Flag Fleet takes its share.":648,[u.s6]:649,"Pay up, and you may keep your ship.":650,[u.E]:651,[u.E6]:652,[u.uu]:653,[u.zT]:654,[u.aW]:655,[u.i7]:656,"Steady, gunners!":657,"Fire ships! Cut the grapples!":658,"The Company will not be pleased.":659,"Trade, or we burn your harbours.":660,"A broadside settles most arguments.":661,"Back to Formosa. Write to the directors.":662,"Now we discuss trade terms.":663,[u.A]:664,[u.yt]:665,[u.xo]:666,[u.z9]:667,[u.di]:668,"These walls were built by Europe's best.":669,"Man the bastions!":670,"No relief ship yet. We hold.":671,[u.bc]:672,"Bastions cover every angle.":673,"A fort is patient. So am I.":674,"Nine months. I surrender, with honour.":675,"I will write a book about this.":676,[u.Q]:677,[u.dA]:678,[u.hj]:679,"Rations are tight. Hold anyway.":680,"Batavia will send help. Surely.":681,[u.qt]:682,"Chain the ships together! Hold the line!":683,"A raft burned. I have a hundred more.":684,"The wind is turning. Pull back!":685,"Your boats are firewood.":686,"An emperor of Han crushes rebels.":687,"Fire ships. Always fire ships.":688,"The lake is mine. Then the empire.":689,[u.Y]:690,[u.uM]:691,[u.Ce]:692,[u.pw]:693,[u.DM]:694,[u.O]:695,"Stones! Tiles! Anything!":696,"A gap in the wall. Fill it!":697,[u.DK]:698,"Beiping does not fall.":699,"The townsfolk have good aim.":700,"Tell my husband I tried.":701,"Hold until he returns. And we did.":702,[u.y]:703,[u.z1]:704,[u.Bl]:705,[u.mU]:706,[u.B]:707,"Gather the banners!":708,[u.yf]:709,"One army stung me. Three more to go.":710,"One road closed.":711,"Divide, and I conquer.":712,"My sons will finish what I began.":713,"Four armies, four roads, one answer.":714,[u.pU]:715,[u.uZ]:716,[u.bh]:717,[u.bI]:718,"Clever. Just like Hong Chengchou.":719,[u.nF]:720,"A small loss. Patience wins sieges.":721,[u.cb]:722,[u.h3]:723,"The Ming relief army is not coming.":724,[u.dn]:725,[u.mw]:726,[u.I]:727,[u.a3]:728,[u.sp]:729,[u.Aj]:730,"Beyond the Great Wall, the land is ours.":731,[u.tL]:732,[u.wc]:733,"Armies fall. Songs remain.":734,"I have survived worse men than you.":735,"All this, for a singer from Suzhou.":736,"The dust storm is coming.":737,"Let the poets decide who was to blame.":738,"A dynasty falls, and I am still singing.":739,[u.f]:740,[u.mP]:741,[u.yg]:742,"Hold the line until the banners arrive.":743,[u.sU]:744}
